{
  "url": "https://baike.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1370/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header",
  "title": "核心能力-圣芙蕾雅档案馆-崩坏3WIKI",
  "content_id": 1370,
  "main_content": "核心能力  月之环 · 普攻核心月之环 · 必杀核心月之环 · QTE核心月之环 · 闪避核心  月之环 · 普攻核心 此核心将强化队伍普攻效果【默认解锁】使用角色的特殊技攻击可以积攒月之环能量白热状态下，角色的普攻和特殊技机制发生变化（需解锁对应天赋）战斗状态下，月之环能量会自动积攒【月之环4级解锁】进入白热状态时，回满角色的动能【月之环5级解锁】白热状态下，角色的动能槽上限翻倍【月之环15级解锁】角色可自动回复动能【月之环19级解锁】白热状态的持续时间增加5秒【月之环23级解锁】白热状态下，使用普攻/特殊技攻击额外获得50%暴击伤害加成【月之环27级解锁】  月之环 · 必杀核心 此核心将强化队伍必杀技效果【月之环6级解锁】使用角色的必杀技攻击可以积攒月之环能量白热状态下，每个角色可使用一次超级必杀技（需解锁对应天赋）进入白热状态时，刷新角色的必杀技冷却时间【月之环8级解锁】角色的必杀技冷却时间降低50%【月之环16级解锁】月之环能量积攒速率额外提高20%【月之环20级解锁】角色的能量获取速率额外提高20%【月之环24级解锁】白热状态下，使用必杀技攻击额外获得50%暴击伤害加成【月之环28级解锁】  月之环 · QTE核心 此核心将强化队伍QTE效果【月之环9级解锁】换人、使用角色的QTE攻击可以积攒月之环能量白热状态下，触发任意角色QTE时会同步触发另个角色的QTE进入白热状态时，刷新角色的换人冷却时间并触发全队QTE【月之环11级解锁】敌人的气绝状态持续时间增加2秒【月之环17级解锁】角色给敌人积累积蓄槽的速度提高50%【月之环21级解锁】白热状态的持续时间增加10秒【月之环25级解锁】白热状态下，使用QTE攻击额外获得65%暴击伤害加成【月之环29级解锁】  月之环 · 闪避核心 此核心将强化队伍极限闪避/跳跃效果【月之环12级解锁】受到攻击/极限闪避/跳跃、使用角色的闪避/跳跃反击可以积攒月之环能量白热状态下，刷新角色极限闪避技能的冷却时间，且闪避后可以直接发动闪避反击攻击白热状态的持续时间增加5秒【月之环14级解锁】白热状态下，角色极限跳跃躲开近战攻击后可以直接发动跳跃反击攻击，该效果全队每10秒可以触发一次【月之环18级解锁】战斗状态下，闪避可以直接触发场上角色的极限闪避技能【月之环22级解锁】白热状态的持续时间增加10秒【月之环26级解锁】白热状态下，使用反击攻击额外获得30%暴击伤害加成【月之环30级解锁】   \n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载",
  "html_content": "<div data-v-f0365338=\"\"><h1 data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__title\">核心能力</h1> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__divider\"></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tabs\" style=\"top: 0px;\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab detail_tab--active\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">月之环 · 普攻核心</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">月之环 · 必杀核心</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">月之环 · QTE核心</div></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail_tab-item\">月之环 · 闪避核心</div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"\"><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22desc%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%20%C2%B7%20%E6%99%AE%E6%94%BB%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%B0%86%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8D%E6%99%AE%E6%94%BB%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%90%E9%BB%98%E8%AE%A4%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%8A%80%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%A7%AF%E6%94%92%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%99%AE%E6%94%BB%E5%92%8C%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%BA%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%91%E7%94%9F%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%EF%BC%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5%A4%A9%E8%B5%8B%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%88%98%E6%96%97%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E4%BC%9A%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E7%A7%AF%E6%94%92%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF4%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%9E%E6%BB%A1%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E8%83%BD%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF5%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%8A%A8%E8%83%BD%E6%A7%BD%E4%B8%8A%E9%99%90%E7%BF%BB%E5%80%8D%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF15%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8F%AF%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%9B%9E%E5%A4%8D%E5%8A%A8%E8%83%BD%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF19%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A05%E7%A7%92%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF23%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%99%AE%E6%94%BB%2F%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%8A%80%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E9%A2%9D%E5%A4%96%E8%8E%B7%E5%BE%9750%25%E6%9A%B4%E5%87%BB%E4%BC%A4%E5%AE%B3%E5%8A%A0%E6%88%90%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF27%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1639537444734\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"desc\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--desc obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>月之环 · 普攻核心</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">此核心将强化队伍普攻效果【默认解锁】</p><ul><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用角色的特殊技攻击可以积攒月之环能量</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，角色的普攻和特殊技机制发生变化（需解锁对应天赋）</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">战斗状态下，月之环能量会自动积攒【月之环4级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">进入白热状态时，回满角色的动能【月之环5级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，角色的动能槽上限翻倍【月之环15级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色可自动回复动能【月之环19级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态的持续时间增加5秒【月之环23级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，使用普攻/特殊技攻击额外获得50%暴击伤害加成【月之环27级解锁】</p></li></ul></div> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22desc%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%20%C2%B7%20%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%B0%86%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8D%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF6%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%A7%AF%E6%94%92%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%AA%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8F%AF%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%80%E6%AC%A1%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E5%BF%85%E6%9D%80%E6%8A%80%EF%BC%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E5%AF%B9%E5%BA%94%E5