角色的必杀技攻击可以积攒月之环能量</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，每个角色可使用一次超级必杀技（需解锁对应天赋）</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">进入白热状态时，刷新角色的必杀技冷却时间【月之环8级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色的必杀技冷却时间降低50%【月之环16级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">月之环能量积攒速率额外提高20%【月之环20级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色的能量获取速率额外提高20%【月之环24级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，使用必杀技攻击额外获得50%暴击伤害加成【月之环28级解锁】</p></li></ul></div> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22desc%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%20%C2%B7%20QTE%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%B0%86%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8DQTE%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF9%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%8D%A2%E4%BA%BA%E3%80%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84QTE%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%A7%AF%E6%94%92%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E4%BB%BB%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2QTE%E6%97%B6%E4%BC%9A%E5%90%8C%E6%AD%A5%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%AA%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84QTE%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%B7%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E6%8D%A2%E4%BA%BA%E5%86%B7%E5%8D%B4%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%B9%B6%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E5%85%A8%E9%98%9FQT