e: pre-wrap;\">角色给敌人积累积蓄槽的速度提高50%【月之环21级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态的持续时间增加10秒【月之环25级解锁】</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">白热状态下，使用QTE攻击额外获得65%暴击伤害加成【月之环29级解锁】</p></li></ul></div> <!----></div></div></div><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p></div><div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__content\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl obc-tmpl--col-l2r1\" data-data=\"%5B%7B%22tmplKey%22%3A%22general%22%2C%22partKey%22%3A%22desc%22%2C%22data%22%3A%7B%22layout_%22%3A%22banner%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%20%C2%B7%20%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E6%AD%A4%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E5%B0%86%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E9%98%9F%E4%BC%8D%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%2F%E8%B7%B3%E8%B7%83%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF12%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E5%8F%97%E5%88%B0%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%2F%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%2F%E8%B7%B3%E8%B7%83%E3%80%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%2F%E8%B7%B3%E8%B7%83%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%A7%AF%E6%94%92%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E5%88%B7%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E7%9A%84%E5%86%B7%E5%8D%B4%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%94%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%E5%90%8E%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%91%E5%8A%A8%E9%97%AA%E9%81%BF%E5%8F%8D%E5%87%BB%E6%94%BB%E5%87%BB%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fli%3E%3Cli%3E%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%99%BD%E7%83%AD%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E7%9A%84%E6%8C%81%E7%BB%AD%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%A2%9E%E5%8A%A05%E7%A7%92%E3%80%90%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E7%8E%AF14%E7%BA%A7%E8%A7%A3%E9%94%81%E3%80%91%3C